# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw source documents, per release tag (see sources/README.md).
# The XMI / UML metamodel and textual sources ARE committed for the tags in the
# rolling window, so the generator tests are reproducible. OMG PDF
# specifications are copyrighted and MUST NOT be committed, for any tag.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
sources/**/specs/*
!sources/**/.gitkeep

# Belt and braces: no OMG PDF may be committed from anywhere in the tree. The
# per-tag rule above moved once already, and a stale copy of the previous layout
# was very nearly committed as a result.
*.pdf

# Inputs for tags outside the committed rolling window are generated locally by
# tools/spec-extract's fetcher; only the window's tags are tracked. Add an
# exception here when the window moves (see knowledge/versions.json).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated spec knowledge base (verbatim OMG spec text). Regenerated locally
# from the PDFs by tools/spec-extract; NOT redistributed (OMG terms). The
# directory placeholders are kept so the layout is tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Matched at ANY depth on purpose. These patterns were previously anchored to a
# single layout; moving to the per-tag layout silently stopped them matching the
# old paths, and 1552 files of verbatim OMG clause text were committed as a
# result. Depth-independent patterns cannot be broken by moving the tree again.
**/spec/kerml/*
**/spec/sysml2/*
!**/.gitkeep

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .NET (tools/metamodel-gen)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# What the documented local publish/pack of the CLI writes (see tools/hypha-cli/README.md).
publish/
ReleaseBuilds/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python (tools/spec-extract)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
